    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cda6e72f7bfaa699582b2a993d9741db.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the fugitive criminal, convicted for smuggling overly addictive sex toys. You manage to flee, taking advantage of a prison riot, and you are lucky enough to find the rusty old spaceship nearby, the bad thing is that it falls into disrepair after just one hyperjump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/2292b59b2ee4f044545fb096f81c8609.poster.avif?t=1755537709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/2292b59b2ee4f044545fb096f81c8609.webm?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/2292b59b2ee4f044545fb096f81c8609.mp4?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have to put all your energy into fixing it, if you want to reach the destination, of course. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/96e739a4ca655df564b5d30499a7a297.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't just an escape story - it's a thrilling adventure full of unexpected encounters, edgy situations and opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/88ac2ceecd2713cd26114afe01cddb1b.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cd121e3ec139fb784aa10d457dbd29a8.poster.avif?t=1755537709\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cd121e3ec139fb784aa10d457dbd29a8.webm?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cd121e3ec139fb784aa10d457dbd29a8.mp4?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey you\u2019ll meet many charismatic and unique heroines ready to join, each of whom brings something special to the crew. You will get to know sexy milfs - each with their own story, secrets and motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/62ca0c48145867d8f88027edff8b1de2.poster.avif?t=1755537709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/62ca0c48145867d8f88027edff8b1de2.webm?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/62ca0c48145867d8f88027edff8b1de2.mp4?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get on your ship, get to know your crew, explore the vast space and find your lost treasure to become rich, free and surrounded with hot milfs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/5127183b547462833b6a609b138c884d.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=475 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cda6e72f7bfaa699582b2a993d9741db.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the fugitive criminal, convicted for smuggling overly addictive sex toys. You manage to flee, taking advantage of a prison riot, and you are lucky enough to find the rusty old spaceship nearby, the bad thing is that it falls into disrepair after just one hyperjump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/2292b59b2ee4f044545fb096f81c8609.poster.avif?t=1755537709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/2292b59b2ee4f044545fb096f81c8609.webm?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/2292b59b2ee4f044545fb096f81c8609.mp4?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have to put all your energy into fixing it, if you want to reach the destination, of course. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/96e739a4ca655df564b5d30499a7a297.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't just an escape story - it's a thrilling adventure full of unexpected encounters, edgy situations and opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/88ac2ceecd2713cd26114afe01cddb1b.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cd121e3ec139fb784aa10d457dbd29a8.poster.avif?t=1755537709\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cd121e3ec139fb784aa10d457dbd29a8.webm?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/cd121e3ec139fb784aa10d457dbd29a8.mp4?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey you\u2019ll meet many charismatic and unique heroines ready to join, each of whom brings something special to the crew. You will get to know sexy milfs - each with their own story, secrets and motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/62ca0c48145867d8f88027edff8b1de2.poster.avif?t=1755537709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/62ca0c48145867d8f88027edff8b1de2.webm?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/62ca0c48145867d8f88027edff8b1de2.mp4?t=1755537709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get on your ship, get to know your crew, explore the vast space and find your lost treasure to become rich, free and surrounded with hot milfs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172290/extras/5127183b547462833b6a609b138c884d.avif?t=1755537709\" width=598 height=475 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Milfy Way: Space Orgasm \ud83e\ude90\ud83d\udd1e is a wild mix between a dating sim, voyeur sim, survival with crafting and a hot adult road movie in a retrofuturistic sci-fi setting! Flee the prison, fix your ship, explore the galaxy, seduce the girls and find the hidden treasure that\u2019ll make you rich!",
